            "review_text": "Hưng N\n2 contributions\n0\nExperience the unique Shamoji wood mouse\nApr 2026 • Couples\nThe point that impressed me most was how the food was served on the giant wooden mosquitoes. The feeling of receiving food directly from the fishermen’s hands through the long mouth is very interesting and close. The open kitchen space helps us to observe the whole process of baking flower coal, a truly meaningful culinary experience.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten April 3, 2026",
